    <text><list><item>Colonoscopy with biopsy, CT of the chest, abdomen, and pelvis, and baseline CEA for iron deficiency anemia with rectal bleeding in a man of 64. Guideline: NCCN Clinical Practice Guidelines in Oncology: Colon Cancer, Version 4.2025 (2025); AGA Clinical Practice Guidelines on the Gastrointestinal Evaluation of Iron Deficiency Anemia (2020); CMID: Clinical Monitoring Intelligence Database, colorectal cancer and anemia monographs (2026) [S]</item><item>Medical oncology consultation to review staging, the indeterminate liver lesion, the order of treatment, and adjuvant therapy. Guideline: NCCN Clinical Practice Guidelines in Oncology: Colon Cancer, Version 4.2025 (2025) [S]</item></list></text>

